OL,3,GNEWSAResidents evacuated from homes
OL,4,Aduring security alert
OL,5,
OL,6,FForensic teams remain at the scene of a
OL,7,Fsecurity alert in Lurgan where
OL,8,Fresidents have been evacuated from
OL,9,Ftheir homes.
OL,11,FA suspicious object is being examined
OL,12,Fin James Street.
OL,14,FThe street has been closed to traffic
OL,15,Fand pedestrians, police have said.
OL,17,FDemocratic Unionist Party councillor
OL,18,FPeter Haire said the council has opened
OL,19,FLurgan Town Hall for those affected.
